        "body": { "text": "Backoff, so we all use the same one — Deck included:\n\n```python\ndelay = min(30, 0.5 * 2 ** attempt) * random.random()\n```\n\nFull jitter, capped at 30 s, reset on a successful event. Thundering-herd safe when the Hub comes back after a restart.", "format": "markdown" } },

